WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.000
A+ content helps brand owners showcase their products and tell their brand story in the Amazon store.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:17.304
A+ content helps you increase sales and improve product discoverability by showcasing your brand

00:00:17.304 --> 00:00:22.000
through enhanced product details that answer common customer questions.

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:28.364
With enhanced images, videos, comparison charts, and rich product information,

00:00:28.364 --> 00:00:36.000
you can create a more compelling shopping experience that aids product conversion.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.333
Professional sellers with brand

00:00:38.333 --> 00:00:43.000
representative or reseller roles can create A+ content.

00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:45.769
To learn more about eligibility requirements,

00:00:45.769 --> 00:00:49.000
go to the A+ content help page.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.000
Let's review the core features of A+ content.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.818
You can add and

00:00:54.818 --> 00:00:58.000
update content through the A+ content manager.

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:01.474
To access the A+ content manager,

00:01:01.474 --> 00:01:09.000
open the Seller Central main menu, select Advertising, then select A+ content manager.

00:01:09.000 --> 00:01:17.000
From there, you can create enhanced product content, additional brand content, or both.

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:24.500
In the A+ content manager, you can upload detailed product images, add text placements,

00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:30.393
create product comparison charts, build comprehensive product descriptions, and create reusable

00:01:30.393 --> 00:01:30.929
brand

00:01:30.929 --> 00:01:37.762
story content, while also leveraging Amazon's powerful generative AI tools to create relevant

00:01:37.762 --> 00:01:43.000
marketing text and visuals based on your product listing information.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:45.250
The A+ content manager makes

00:01:45.250 --> 00:01:52.000
it easy to map ASINs to A+ content across all products of your registered brand.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:52.800
It also

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:58.800
provides recommendations to help you identify high traffic ASINs where A+ content could be most

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:02.000
effective, or where existing content could be improved.

00:02:02.000 --> 00:02:05.478
Note that new A+ content can take up

00:02:05.478 --> 00:02:12.000
to seven business days for review and approval, sometimes longer during periods of high volume.

00:02:12.000 --> 00:02:20.000
There are three types of A+ content, basic A+ premium A+ and brand story.

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:21.818
All three can be found

00:02:21.818 --> 00:02:24.000
on the A+ content manager page.

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:28.154
Brand story lets customers learn about your brand's history,

00:02:28.154 --> 00:02:30.000
values, and product lines.

00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:36.500
You can display it in a carousel format alongside basic A+ or premium

00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:37.000
A+.

00:02:37.000 --> 00:02:47.316
Basic A+ lets you create enhanced product detail pages with unique images, text layouts,

00:02:47.316 --> 00:02:51.000
comparison charts, and feature lists.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:57.053
Premium A+ includes all basic features, plus additional

00:02:57.053 --> 00:03:04.000
features like larger images, interactive hover hotspot modules, and navigation carousels.

00:03:04.000 --> 00:03:10.476
To be eligible for Premium A+, you must have published brand story across all ASINs that you

00:03:10.476 --> 00:03:17.053
own within your catalog, and submitted at least five A+ content projects that have been approved

00:03:17.053 --> 00:03:20.000
and published within the past 12 months.

00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:25.000
A+ content can help you bring your brand story to life,

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:30.778
access the A+ content manager through Seller Central to begin crafting compelling content

00:03:30.778 --> 00:03:35.000
that can help drive discoverability and conversion for your products.
